    "body": "Hmm, in Gecko this doesn't happen mostly by chance (because we don't bother mapping attributes on disconnected elements). We also don't quite deal with removal, and behavior with multiple `<body>` elements is bizarre (last attribute addition or modification wins).\r\n\r\nI'd rather investigate that in a follow-up commit, needs more tests and potentially changing behavior.",
